    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Aloha Play</strong> \ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udf34</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax and Have Fun\u2014An Adventure Beyond Just Catching Chickens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Aloha Play, a fun and relaxing casual game for players of all ages! Step into the role of a helpful farmhand and take on the challenge of rounding up runaway chickens for the farmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1fGame Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Adorable and Relaxing Style \u2013 Immerse yourself in a charming and cozy atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Easy to Pick Up and Play \u2013 Simple controls for a fun and effortless experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Test Your Speed and Skills \u2013 The chickens are fast! Can you catch them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fun for Everyone \u2013 Perfect for a quick play session or a longer adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting Updates on the Horizon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catching chickens is just the start! We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Aloha Play is expanding with a variety of new maps, each bringing unique environments and challenges to explore. Alongside these maps, we\u2019re adding a wealth of new features and content to make your experience even more delightful. From new adventures to fun surprises, Aloha Play is growing into a much bigger world of fun\u2014stay tuned for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your chicken-catching adventure today, and get ready for so much more!\ud83d\udc14\ud83c\udf89</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Aloha Play</strong> \ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udf34</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax and Have Fun\u2014An Adventure Beyond Just Catching Chickens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Aloha Play, a fun and relaxing casual game for players of all ages! Step into the role of a helpful farmhand and take on the challenge of rounding up runaway chickens for the farmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1fGame Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Adorable and Relaxing Style \u2013 Immerse yourself in a charming and cozy atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Easy to Pick Up and Play \u2013 Simple controls for a fun and effortless experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Test Your Speed and Skills \u2013 The chickens are fast! Can you catch them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fun for Everyone \u2013 Perfect for a quick play session or a longer adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting Updates on the Horizon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catching chickens is just the start! We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Aloha Play is expanding with a variety of new maps, each bringing unique environments and challenges to explore. Alongside these maps, we\u2019re adding a wealth of new features and content to make your experience even more delightful. From new adventures to fun surprises, Aloha Play is growing into a much bigger world of fun\u2014stay tuned for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your chicken-catching adventure today, and get ready for so much more!\ud83d\udc14\ud83c\udf89</p>",
